WEBVTT

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:03.680
What... is so wrong about it?

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:07.050
I don't want to show people who I really am!

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:09.240
I don't want to cause trouble 
for the people around me,

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.120
and having people stare at me...

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:13.740
being embarrassed... I don't want that!

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:17.170
That's why I read the 
room and kill who I am!

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:18.870
I blend into my surroundings!

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:21.420
I will live normally, without making waves!

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.760
What's so wrong about that?!

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:27.540
If that's what you want to do,

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.220
then spend your whole life living that way.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:40.570
Um, Kanade-chan...

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.770
I-I'm so sorry!

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:45.780
I sort of lost my composure.

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:47.820
Oh, I'm so embarrassed.

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:51.270
I have the feeling I shouted 
something really pathetic.

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:54.700
But thank you for today.

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:56.280
Talking about the past...

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:57.930
has made me feel a little better.

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.770
Shikijou-kun said he'd get in touch again,

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:02.980
so I'm going to try really hard next time.

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:04.290
Kanade-chan.

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:08.600
Don't push yourself so hard.

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:13.430
I'm not.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:16.930
Thank you, Himuro-senpai.

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:21.350
<i>This girl has always read 
the room like this,</i>

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:24.180
<i>and acted "normal," with a smile.</i>

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:27.270
<i>When I think about that, I...</i>

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:32.310
<i>I no longer know what I should say to her.</i>

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:55.800
<b>Science Fell in Love, 
So I Tried to Prove It [r=1-sinθ]</b>

