00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:08.450
Proof 9
Science-types Fell in Love, 
So They Tried Preparing for a Campus Festival.

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:11.230
<i>Are you free this weekend?</i>

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:11.750
<b>Shikijou Naoya</b>

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:11.750
Today

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:11.750
Nao

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:11.750
<b>Are you free this weekend?
If you wouldn't mind, what do you
think about going somewhere again?</b>

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:14.250
<i>If you wouldn't mind, what do you 
think about going somewhere again?</i>

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:20.290
<i>Why did I shout so much?</i>

00:03:23.030 --> 00:03:25.900
<i>Even if I talked back to senpai 
because I was angry...</i>

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:28.130
<i>all that will happen is that things 
will be awkward between us.</i>

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:31.590
<i>He'll only think I'm weird.</i>

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:36.640
Wow! It's so cute!

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:38.470
Hey, Papa! Mama!

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:40.580
I want this randoseru backpack!

00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:43.340
What? A blue one?

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:45.480
Girls usually get red, don't they?

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:48.900
That's right, Kotonoha. 
People will think you're weird.

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:50.890
Really?

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:56.670
<b>Randoseru Backpacks</b>

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:56.090
<i>Girl's normally carry a red randoseru.</i>

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:02.420
Mama! Tomoha broke it!

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:05.790
Honestly! You're the older 
sister here. Control yourself!

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:07.800
<i>Older sisters...</i>

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:10.550
<i>have to control themselves.</i>

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:12.820
Mama! Look!

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:15.560
Kotonoha! Use the chairs normally!

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:20.580
I feel like she's a little wilder 
than the other children around her.

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:23.440
Do you think she's strange somehow?

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:27.830
You're worrying too much. 
She's a child, so toys will get broken.

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:29.190
But...

00:04:29.190 --> 00:04:32.370
Don't worry. Kotonoha is a normal child.

00:04:35.410 --> 00:04:38.200
Oh, my. How impressive, Kotonoha-chan.

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:41.980
You do chores and you even 
help take care of Tomoha-kun.

00:04:41.980 --> 00:04:44.060
What a responsible older sister.

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:48.720
<b>Entrance
Ceremony</b>

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:54.830
<i>The world is overflowing 
with all kinds of "normal."</i>

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:57.990
<i>Girls' red randoseru backpacks...</i>

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:00.350
<i>Older sisters who are good 
at looking after others...</i>

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:03.490
<i>Going to school every day...</i>

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:07.490
<i>Students at their desks, taking notes...</i>

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:11.130
What? The conversation was headed 
for karaoke just now, wasn't it?

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:12.700
That's right.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.500
B-But...

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.630
Seriously. Get a clue.

00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:18.840
Hey, Kanade. You think so, too, right?

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:22.510
Huh? Yeah. You're right. 
Normally, that's how it would go, right?

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:25.190
<i>Me, reading the room to get a clue...</i>

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:28.370
<i>Popular songs...</i>

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:31.390
<i>Matching school uniforms...</i>

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:35.230
<i>Spending time after school 
with a group of friends...</i>

00:05:36.010 --> 00:05:39.240
<i>Being able to live buried 
amidst all the "normal"</i>

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:42.080
<i>gave me a sense of safety. 
It felt comfortable.</i>

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:45.050
<i>After all...</i>

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:49.030
Hey, blue randoseru girl!

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:52.040
<i>...if you're not normal, it's hard to exist.</i>

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:56.040
<i>If you're not normal...</i>

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:58.300
<i>no one will accept you.</i>

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:03.050
<i>If you're not normal, people will 
stare at you like you're peculiar.</i>

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:06.960
Takahashi-sensei has been injured.

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:10.040
As he's in the hospital, he 
will be taking two months off.

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:12.600
Hey, is it for real?

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:15.780
There's a rumor that Kanade was the 
one who hurt Takahashi-sensei.

00:06:15.780 --> 00:06:18.150
I heard those two were a couple.

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:20.060
Someone in the class next 
door said they saw it.

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:22.700
What? So does that mean he got 
hurt in a lover's quarrel?

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:24.360
Wow, that's crazy.

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:27.080
She was probably cozying up to get better 
scores on her report card, right?

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:29.820
Hey! Kanade's not like that!

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:33.320
Kanade's been studying really hard lately!

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:36.640
There's no way she'd be dating 
our teacher in secret!

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:40.830
I'm truly so very sorry for what's happened.

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:44.840
No, I'm sorry. 
Physically, I'm much too frail.

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:47.850
Kanade-kun, please don't let it worry you.

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:54.590
Honestly.

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:58.800
This is why I was against them 
teaching you martial arts, Kotonoha.

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:02.340
And those rumors of a love affair 
with your teacher on top of it!

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:04.880
You're not that kind of girl, right?

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:09.250
I wouldn't do anything that bizarre, Mom.

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:11.360
<i>I have to be normal.</i>

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:12.820
<i>With my family,</i>

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:15.360
<i>my friends at school,</i>

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:18.120
Generalized traveling salesman problem (GTSP)

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:18.120
<i>and even in that lab, it's the same.</i>

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:21.850
<i>If I'm not normal, 
things will get out of control.</i>

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:23.480
<i>Be normal.</i>

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:26.380
<i>That's what everyone wants from me.</i>

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:33.970
<i>You yourself will be an empty 
set filled with nothing.</i>

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:36.150
<i>That is a truly stupid way to live.</i>

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:39.290
...Kanade-san?

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:39.940
Kanade-san?

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:43.220
I'm sorry!

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:45.780
What's wrong? You're not eating?

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:47.650
No, I'm eating.

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:49.640
But, Kanade-san...

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:51.540
is that really enough?

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:54.310
Well, yes, pretty much.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:58.070
I'm always surprised by 
how little girls eat.

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:06.650
Um, Shikijou-san. There's something 
I've been wanting to ask you.

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:08.250
What is it?

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:10.050
Um, well...

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:14.060
Why did you want to go out with me?

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:14.800
Huh?

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:17.310
Oh...

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:19.440
Y-Yeah, you're right.

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:21.570
We didn't even talk in Okinawa.

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:23.550
From your perspective, Kanade-san, 
it must be a mystery, right?

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:27.550
I guess it was sort of love at first sight.

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:31.420
Kanade-san...you've got a 
traditional kind of beauty.

00:08:31.420 --> 00:08:33.560
You could say you're a 
dead strike for my ideal.

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:37.070
You're my ideal. When you were 
giving your presentation too.

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:38.200
What?

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:42.060
When I was in middle school, 
I went pretty far off the rails.

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:45.110
I caused a lot of trouble for my parents,

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:48.710
so I though the least I could do was 
become a normal, average person.

00:08:48.980 --> 00:08:51.650
I managed to get into a university somehow,

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:54.390
but the level of my lab group was so high...

00:08:54.810 --> 00:08:57.710
all I ever did was make 
Professor Kanou angry.

00:08:58.230 --> 00:09:00.160
And you saw how horribly I 
did with my presentation.

00:09:00.980 --> 00:09:04.140
I ended up showing you the 
embarrassing side of me back then.

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:06.990
But after that, at your 
presentation, Kanade-san...

00:09:06.990 --> 00:09:10.740
you were so valiant and dignified. 
You did everything I couldn't do.

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:15.020
Truly... you were my every 
ideal. I admired you.

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:13.490
Variable Latency Traveling Salesman Problem: a Proposal

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:13.490
Kanade Kotonoha  Ikeda Lab

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:13.490
Saitama University Science & Engineering Graduate Course, Department of Mathematics, Electronics, and Information

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:17.930
That scene burned itself into my eyes.

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:19.800
I just couldn't forget it.

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:23.810
And so, on the spur of the moment, 
I called out to you...

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:28.710
G-Giving a full explanation like 
this is really embarrassing!

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.550
But, well, that's pretty much how it is.

00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:33.600
I'll go pay the bill and come back, okay?

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:38.300
<i>You're wrong, Shikijou-san.</i>

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:41.670
<i>The real me...</i>

00:09:41.670 --> 00:09:44.690
<i>isn't that kind of ideal person.</i>

00:09:45.260 --> 00:09:48.130
<i>I don't have any definite will of 
my own or any rules I live by.</i>

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:50.670
<i>I'm just desperately paying 
blind obedience...</i>

00:09:51.160 --> 00:09:53.920
<i>just an empty set.</i>

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:00.570
Wow!

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:03.390
That's 26 kilograms higher than before!

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:06.210
<b>Punch Power</b>

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:06.210
<b>Downtown Rocky</b>

00:10:03.390 --> 00:10:06.210
Well... That's about average, though, right?

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.690
Kanade-san, would you like to try?

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:12.380
It's pretty liberating.

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:14.440
Then... just once.

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:18.970
I wonder if they're built 
like striking pads.

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:24.220
<b>Speed v</b>

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:24.220
<b>Mass m</b>

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:24.220
<b>m = mass
v = velocity</b>

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:24.220
<b>I = impulse = the momentum with which objects collide</b>

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:24.300
The impulse of a punch can be expressed 
through multiplying mass by velocity,

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:29.730
<b>Weighty Punch</b>

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:29.730
<b>Quick Punch</b>

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:29.730
<b>Impulse</b>

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:29.730
<b>Time</b>

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:29.730
<b>Fast Punch</b>

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:29.730
<b>Slow Punch</b>

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:29.740
but a fast punch is more likely than a weighty 
punch to increase impulse F to the greatest value.

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:34.600
Which is why, even though I weigh less 
than a man, if I have enough speed...

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:40.610
<b>Striking Pat</b>

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:40.610
<b>Speed of Fall is
Measured</b>

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:40.610
<b>Force of Punch</b>

00:10:34.890 --> 00:10:38.370
Since it's the speed at which 
the pad falls that's measured,

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:40.620
I should try to apply force in 
a slightly downward direction.

00:10:41.230 --> 00:10:45.830
I'll shift my center of gravity and use 
it as an axle to twist my whole body!

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:54.130
<b>Punch Power</b>

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:54.130
<b>Among the Earth's Strongest</b>

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:57.000
Yay! This is a high score, isn't it?

00:10:57.000 --> 00:11:01.020
K-Kanade-san... Who are you?

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:05.260
I'm a science-type girl, you see?

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:08.350
Th-That's amazing, Kanade-san!

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:10.170
Not only are you cute and intelligent,

00:11:10.170 --> 00:11:12.280
you're also strong and cool!

00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:15.860
You are my ideal! Please, marry me!

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:18.270
What are you talking about? Honestly...

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:25.980
<i>That's right. I wanted to be like this, too.</i>

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:28.720
<i>After joining that lab...</i>

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:31.800
<i>and meeting those crazy people...</i>

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:33.800
<i>I'd get fed up with them and 
out their ridiculousness...</i>

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:35.780
<i>but...</i>

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:38.290
<i>a part of me was jealous of them.</i>

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:39.860
<i>I admired them.</i>

00:11:40.270 --> 00:11:44.310
<i>I wanted to be like that, too. 
I wanted to live honestly.</i>

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:48.540
<i>The truth was that I 
wanted a blue randoseru!</i>

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:56.710
It's pretty liberating.

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:01.380
Oh, I-I don't know...

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:03.630
I've never done anything like this before.

00:12:04.930 --> 00:12:08.190
Yeah, well... A girl who's 
really good at this...

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:10.450
would be a little scary, right?

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:13.210
Right?

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:15.330
Normally, that'd be scary, wouldn't it?

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:17.450
<i>I have to be normal.</i>

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:20.470
<i>That's what everyone wants from me.</i>

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:22.480
<i>I won't hurt anyone.</i>

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:23.960
Where should we go next?

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:25.760
<i>I won't destroy anything.</i>

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:30.640
Hmm, let's see. Shikijou-san, is 
there anything you want to do?

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:29.890
<i>Like air...</i>

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:32.680
<i>I'll be empty.</i>

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:39.990
Science Fell in Love,
So I Tried to Prove It [<b>r=1-sinθ</b>]

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:46.780
Well now, the November campus festival, 
Mutsumi Festival, is coming up soon.

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:49.040
A festival! Yeah!

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:52.050
Like last year, the Ikeda
Lab should present something

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:55.530
that will be fun for everyone who comes.

00:12:55.530 --> 00:12:57.910
Yeah! I love festivals!

00:12:57.910 --> 00:12:59.730
They're perfect for drinking alcohol!

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:01.930
Alcohol isn't served until after 8 PM.

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:05.260
Don't drink vodka and go berserk 
like you did last year.

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:07.050
So, he went berserk last year?

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:08.920
<i>The Mutsumi Festival...</i>

00:13:09.340 --> 00:13:11.560
<i>Lots of people from outside of 
the university will be attending.</i>

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:14.310
<i>We might be able to run very 
interesting experiments.</i>

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:19.180
<i>Beyond that, I'll look around 
with Yukimura-kun...</i>

00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:21.310
<i>and if things go well and we 
achieve a good atmosphere...</i>

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:25.980
<i>But...</i>

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:30.310
<i>ever since that day, those two have 
remained somewhat awkward with each other.</i>

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:30.310
Seriously. I was a major hassle.

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:32.910
What? Really?

00:13:30.770 --> 00:13:32.900
<i>She behaving the same as she always has,</i>

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:36.390
<i>but it's possible that Kanade-chan's 
love life isn't going well.</i>

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:39.080
Please don't go wild this year, okay?

00:13:36.390 --> 00:13:39.090
<i>In the face of that, to aggressively 
seek snuggles with Yukimura-kun...</i>

00:13:39.350 --> 00:13:41.720
<i>somehow makes me feel bad.</i>

00:13:41.720 --> 00:13:44.000
<i>I should stay calm and rational here.</i>

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:50.460
Every year, we hold a presentation to 
introduce our research to the visitors.

00:13:50.460 --> 00:13:53.040
How should we do it this year?

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:55.690
Why don't we just do what we did last year?

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:58.540
Ibarada-kun, could you at least 
show a little more enthusiasm?

